# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NEISS source data is NOT committed.
#
# The raw annual archived files are ~1.4 GB and are publicly available from the
# CPSC. `make download` fetches them from the official archive; the source URL,
# server timestamp and download time for every file are recorded in
# outputs/reports/download_log.csv, which IS committed, so the exact data
# vintage used in the paper remains verifiable without redistributing the files.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/raw/neiss/*
!data/raw/neiss/.gitkeep
data/intermediate/
data/processed/

# Keep the manual-download instructions
!data/raw/README_download.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.Python
.venv/
venv/
env/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# R
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.Rhistory
.RData
.Rproj.user/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Rendering scratch output (regenerated by the pipeline)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
outputs/reports/docx_render_qc/

